-- src:10317 | (2) The notice must be given within the period of 14 days beginning with the end of the period specified in the notice under section 790D, 790DA, 790E or 790EA.
@ref s 790EB(2) The notice must be given within the period of 14 days beginning with the end of the period specified in the notice (src:10317)
