    WITHIN (Day (`s 790D(4)(b) the last day of the period of 14 days beginning with the day` `the day on which the period specified in the company's notice ends`) MINUS Day `the day on which the period specified in the company's notice ends`)
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY Company BECAUSE "the registrar was not notified within 14 days beginning with the end of the period specified in the notice (s 790EB(2))"

-- src:10323 | (2) The notice must be given within the period of 14 days beginning with the day on which the person complied with the notice under section 790D, 790DA, 790E or 790EA.
