-- src:10362 | (3) The person must comply with the duty in subsection (2) before the end of the period of one month beginning with the day on which the conditions in subsection (1) are met.
@ref s 790G(3) before the end of the period of one month beginning with the day on which the conditions in subsection (1) are met (src:10362)
GIVEN `the day on which the conditions in subsection (1) are met` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 769(1) act under Part 21 or Part 21A`
`s 790G(3) the duty to act within the period (regulative rule)` MEANS
    PARTY `Person with significant control`
    MUST `s 790G(2) inform the company of the status and give the required particulars`
    WITHIN (Day (`s 790D(3) the last day of the period of one month beginning with the day` `the day on which the conditions in subsection (1) are met`) MINUS Day `the day on which the conditions in subsection (1) are met`)
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `Person with significant control` BECAUSE "the person did not inform the company before the end of the period of one month (s 790G(3))"

