-- src:10559 | (2) The company must comply with the request within the period of 14 days beginning with the day on which the request is made.
@ref s 790LL(2) The company must comply with the request within the period of 14 days beginning with the day on which the request is made (src:10559)
GIVEN `the day on which the request is made` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 769(1) act under Part 21 or Part 21A`
`s 790LL(2) the duty to act within the period (regulative rule)` MEANS
    PARTY Company
    MUST `s 790LL(2) comply with the request`
    WITHIN (Day (`s 790D(4)(b) the last day of the period of 14 days beginning with the day` `the day on which the request is made`) MINUS Day `the day on which the request is made`)
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY Company BECAUSE "the company did not comply with the request within 14 days beginning with the day it was made (s 790LL(2))"

-- src:10575 | (2) The registrar must direct the registrable person to deliver to the registrar, within the period of 14 days beginning with the date of the direction, a statement confirming that the person’s identity is verified (see section 1110A).
@ref s 790LM(2) within the period of 14 days beginning with the date of the direction (src:10575)
GIVEN `the date of the direction` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 769(1) act under Part 21 or Part 21A`
`s 790LM(2) the duty to act within the period (regulative rule)` MEANS
    PARTY `Person with significant control`
    MUST `s 790LM(2) deliver the statement that the person's identity is verified`
    WITHIN (Day (`s 790D(4)(b) the last day of the period of 14 days beginning with the day` `the date of the direction`) MINUS Day `the date of the direction`)
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `Person with significant control` BECAUSE "the statement was not delivered within 14 days beginning with the date of the direction (s 790LM(2))"

-- src:10587 | (3) A statement required by this section must be delivered within the period of 14 days beginning with the appointed day.
@ref s 790LN(3) within the period of 14 days beginning with the appointed day (src:10587)
GIVEN `the appointed day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 769(1) act under Part 21 or Part 21A`
`s 790LN(3) the duty to act within the period (regulative rule)` MEANS
    PARTY `Person with significant control`
    MUST `s 790LN(1) deliver the statement that the person's identity is verified`
    WITHIN (Day (`s 790D(4)(b) the last day of the period of 14 days beginning with the day` `the appointed day`) MINUS Day `the appointed day`)
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `Person with significant control` BECAUSE "the statement was not delivered within 14 days beginning with the appointed day (s 790LN(3))"

-- src:10602 | (2) The registrar must direct the entity to deliver to the registrar, within the period of 28 days beginning with the date of the direction—
@ref s 790LO(2) within the period of 28 days beginning with the date of the direction (src:10602)
GIVEN `the date of the direction` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 769(1) act under Part 21 or Part 21A`
`s 790LO(2) the duty to act within the period (regulative rule)` MEANS
    PARTY `Person with significant control`
    MUST `s 790LO(2) deliver the statements about a relevant officer`
    WITHIN (Day (`s 790LO(2) the last day of the period of 28 days beginning with the day` `the date of the direction`) MINUS Day `the date of the direction`)
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `Person with significant control` BECAUSE "the statements were not delivered within 28 days beginning with the date of the direction (s 790LO(2))"

-- src:10625 | (3) The statements required by this section must be delivered within the period of 28 days beginning with the appointed day.
@ref s 790LP(3) within the period of 28 days beginning with the appointed day (src:10625)
GIVEN `the appointed day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 769(1) act under Part 21 or Part 21A`
`s 790LP(3) the duty to act within the period (regulative rule)` MEANS
    PARTY `Person with significant control`
    MUST `s 790LP(1) deliver the statements about a relevant officer`
    WITHIN (Day (`s 790LO(2) the last day of the period of 28 days beginning with the day` `the appointed day`) MINUS Day `the appointed day`)
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `Person with significant control` BECAUSE "the statements were not delivered within 28 days beginning with the appointed day (s 790LP(3))"

-- src:10104 | (2) The court may on such an application make an order directing the company and any officer of it to make good the default within such time as may be specified in the order.
@ref s 782(2) The court may on such an application make an order (src:10104)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 769(1) act under Part 21 or Part 21A`
`s 782(2) the court's power to order the company and any officer to make good the default (regulative rule)` MEANS
    PARTY Court
    MAY `s 782(2) order the company and any officer of it to make good the default`
    HENCE FULFILLED
